    <bpmn:process id="W_W5121" name="W5121. Store Operations Support Center (Store Hotline) Setup, Staffing &amp; Operating Model" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Strategy (W5105); growth; support-demand analysis
Frequency: At setup + periodic review
Volume: ~1 support center serving 200 stores + 4 DCs
Owner: Director Field Retail Operations / Store Ops (VS-07)
Participants: Store Ops (VS-07), HR (VS-103), IT (VS-27), Finance (VS-17.4), functional SMEs (Merch/HR/Facilities/LP)
Source: workflow W5121 — Store Operations Support Center (Store Hotline) Setup, Staffing &amp; Operating Model</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W5121_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W5121_Lane1" name="Director Field Retail Operations">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5121_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5121_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5121_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5121_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5121_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W5121_Start3" name="Strategy (W5105); growth; support-demand analysis">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5121_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5121_Task4" name="Design the support-center operating model: scope (operational issues, policy…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Design the support-center operating model: scope (operational issues, policy clarification, exception requests, cross-functional coordination — NOT IT-service-desk VS-27 nor HR-shared-services VS-103), channels (phone/hotline, chat, ticketing), hours, SLAs, and the tier structure
Responsible (R): Director Field Retail Operations / Store Ops
Accountable (A): Director Field Retail Operations / VP Store Operations
Duration: At setup + review</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5121_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5121_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5121_Task5" name="Staff &amp; equip: staffing model from demand forecast, the SME/tier structure, the…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Staff &amp; equip: staffing model from demand forecast, the SME/tier structure, the ticketing/CRM tool (distinct from VS-27 ITSM and VS-103 HR case), and training
Responsible (R): Director Field Retail Operations / HR / IT
Accountable (A): Director Field Retail Operations
Duration: At setup</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5121_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5121_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5121_Task6" name="Govern &amp; launch: leadership sign-off (VS-36), the SLA/KPI baseline, the…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Govern &amp; launch: leadership sign-off (VS-36), the SLA/KPI baseline, the integration with field visits (W5114) and escalation (W5122), and go-live
Responsible (R): Director Field Retail Operations / VP Store Operations
Accountable (A): VP Store Operations
Duration: At setup</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5121_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5121_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W5121_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W5121_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W5121_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-763 (ensure controlled execution — Store Support Center, Escalation &amp; Field Operations Analytics (PA-177.3).) | - CTL-763: scope boundaries documented (not IT VS-27 / not HR VS-103); SLAs defined; leadership-approved (VS-36)
Owner: Director Field Retail Operations / Store Ops (VS-07)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W5121_Assoc9" sourceRef="W5121_Annotation8" targetRef="W5121_Start3" associationDirection="None" />
