    <bpmn:process id="W_W5122" name="W5122. Store Issue Intake, Triage, Resolution &amp; Escalation Management" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Store contact (hotline/chat/ticket); field escalation (W5118); system alert
Frequency: Continuous
Volume: ~hundreds–thousands of issues/month across 200 stores
Owner: Store Support Center Lead / Director Field Retail Operations
Participants: Store Managers (VS-07), Regional/District Managers, functional leads (Merch/IT/HR/Facilities/LP), CX (VS-13)
Source: workflow W5122 — Store Issue Intake, Triage, Resolution &amp; Escalation Management</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W5122_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W5122_Lane1" name="Support Center Agent">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5122_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5122_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5122_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W5122_Lane2" name="Support Center Lead">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5122_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5122_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W5122_Start4" name="Store contact (hotline/chat/ticket); field escalation (W5118); system alert">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5122_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5122_Task5" name="Intake &amp; triage: log the issue (channel, category, store, severity), classify…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Intake &amp; triage: log the issue (channel, category, store, severity), classify, route to the right tier/function (Merch/IT/HR/Facilities/LP), and set the SLA
Responsible (R): Support Center Agent
Accountable (A): Support Center Lead
Duration: Per issue (minutes)</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5122_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5122_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5122_Task6" name="Resolve or escalate: tier-1 resolution (knowledge base W5126, policy…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Resolve or escalate: tier-1 resolution (knowledge base W5126, policy clarification, routine exception), or escalate to tier-2 functional SME / Regional Manager / Director per the escalation matrix
Responsible (R): Support Center Agent / Functional SME / Regional Manager
Accountable (A): Support Center Lead
Duration: Per issue</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5122_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5122_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5122_Task7" name="Close &amp; verify: confirm resolution with the store, capture the…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Close &amp; verify: confirm resolution with the store, capture the root-cause/lesson, feed recurring issues to CI (VS-133) and the knowledge base (W5126), and the SLA/quality reporting (W5120/W5127)
Responsible (R): Support Center Lead / Analytics
Accountable (A): Director Field Retail Operations
Duration: Per issue</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5122_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5122_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W5122_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W5122_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W5122_Annotation9">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-763 (ensure controlled execution — Store Support Center, Escalation &amp; Field Operations Analytics (PA-177.3).) | - CTL-763: every issue logged &amp; triaged; SLA monitored; root-cause captured for recurring issues (VS-133)
Owner: Store Support Center Lead / Director Field Retail Operations</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W5122_Assoc10" sourceRef="W5122_Annotation9" targetRef="W5122_Start4" associationDirection="None" />
