    <bpmn:process id="W_W5123" name="W5123. Exception &amp; Override Authorization Handling (Store→HQ Approval Workflow)" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Store/field requests an exception to policy/standard (price override beyond limit, return-policy exception, markdown authorization, policy waiver, special-order approval)
Frequency: Continuous
Volume: ~hundreds–thousands of exception requests/month
Owner: Store Support Center Lead / Director Field Retail Operations
Participants: Store Managers (VS-07), Regional/District Managers, Pricing (VS-01.2/VS-118), Finance (VS-17.4), Compliance (VS-22/VS-118), functional approvers
Source: workflow W5123 — Exception &amp; Override Authorization Handling (Store→HQ Approval Workflow)</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W5123_LaneSet4">
        <bpmn:lane id="W5123_Lane1" name="Support Center Agent">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5123_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5123_Start5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W5123_Lane2" name="Approver">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5123_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W5123_Lane3" name="Support Center">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5123_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5123_End9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W5123_Start5" name="Store/field requests an exception to policy/standard (price override beyond limit…">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5123_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5123_Task6" name="Intake the exception request: the request type, business justification, the…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Intake the exception request: the request type, business justification, the policy/standard being excepted, the $/margin/precedent impact, and the requesting store/manager
Responsible (R): Support Center Agent / Store Manager
Accountable (A): Support Center Lead
Duration: Per request</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5123_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5123_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5123_Task7" name="Evaluate &amp; authorize/deny: route to the approver per the…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Evaluate &amp; authorize/deny: route to the approver per the exception-authorization matrix (dollar threshold, type, risk), the integrity/SoD check (no self-approval), and the compliance review where needed (VS-22/VS-118)
Responsible (R): Approver / Compliance / Director Field Retail Operations
Accountable (A): Per the matrix
Duration: Per request</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5123_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5123_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5123_Task8" name="Execute, log &amp; monitor: execute the approved exception (system override), log…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Execute, log &amp; monitor: execute the approved exception (system override), log for audit (VS-21), monitor exception-volume/spend analytics for abuse or policy-misfit, and feed policy review (VS-133)
Responsible (R): Support Center / Finance / Analytics
Accountable (A): Director Field Retail Operations
Duration: Per request + analytics</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5123_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5123_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W5123_End9" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W5123_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W5123_Annotation10">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-763 (ensure controlled execution — Store Support Center, Escalation &amp; Field Operations Analytics (PA-177.3).) | - CTL-763: authorization matrix enforced; no self-approval (SoD); exceptions logged for audit (VS-21); volume monitored
Owner: Store Support Center Lead / Director Field Retail Operations</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W5123_Assoc11" sourceRef="W5123_Annotation10" targetRef="W5123_Start5" associationDirection="None" />
