    <bpmn:process id="W_W5124" name="W5124. Store Grievance, Concern &amp; Feedback Resolution Channel" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Store staff/manager grievance or concern; feedback submission
Frequency: Continuous
Volume: ~variable grievance/feedback volume across 200 stores
Owner: Director Field Retail Operations / HR (VS-103/VS-84)
Participants: Store staff (VS-19), Store Managers (VS-07), HR/HRBP (VS-103), Labor Relations (VS-84), Ethics (VS-119), Regional Managers
Source: workflow W5124 — Store Grievance, Concern &amp; Feedback Resolution Channel</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W5124_LaneSet4">
        <bpmn:lane id="W5124_Lane1" name="Support Center">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5124_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5124_Start5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W5124_Lane2" name="Director Field Retail Operations">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5124_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W5124_Lane3" name="HRBP">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5124_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5124_End9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W5124_Start5" name="Store staff/manager grievance or concern; feedback submission">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5124_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5124_Task6" name="Receive &amp; classify the grievance/concern: channel (support center, HRBP, ethics…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Receive &amp; classify the grievance/concern: channel (support center, HRBP, ethics line VS-119), type (workplace/managerial/operational/policy/safety), severity, and the confidentiality/anti-retaliation flag
Responsible (R): Support Center / HRBP
Accountable (A): Director Field Retail Operations / HR
Duration: Per case</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5124_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5124_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5124_Task7" name="Investigate &amp; resolve (or route): operational concern → field-manager…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Investigate &amp; resolve (or route): operational concern → field-manager resolution; HR/labor → VS-84/VS-103; ethics/whistleblower → VS-119; safety → VS-24; with anti-retaliation protection
Responsible (R): Director Field Retail Operations / HRBP / Functional Lead
Accountable (A): Director Field Retail Operations / HR
Duration: Per case</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5124_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5124_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5124_Task8" name="Close, document &amp; feedback: resolution to the reporter, documentation, the…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Close, document &amp; feedback: resolution to the reporter, documentation, the systemic-fix where needed (VS-133), and the aggregated grievance analytics (W5127)
Responsible (R): HRBP / Analytics
Accountable (A): Director Field Retail Operations / HR
Duration: Per case</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5124_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5124_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W5124_End9" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W5124_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W5124_Annotation10">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-763 (ensure controlled execution — Store Support Center, Escalation &amp; Field Operations Analytics (PA-177.3).) | - CTL-763: confidentiality &amp; anti-retaliation (VS-119/VS-84); correct routing; resolution documented &amp; fed back
Owner: Director Field Retail Operations / HR (VS-103/VS-84)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
