        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W5125_Lane3" name="Coordinator">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5125_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5125_End9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W5125_Start5" name="Multi-function store issue (e.g. product defect + recall, system outage + manual…">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5125_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5125_Task6" name="Convene the cross-functional case: identify the functions involved, open a…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Convene the cross-functional case: identify the functions involved, open a coordinated case (single ticket linking sub-tasks per function), and assign a single accountable coordinator
Responsible (R): Support Center Lead / Director Field Retail Operations
Accountable (A): Director Field Retail Operations
Duration: Per case</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5125_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5125_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5125_Task7" name="Coordinate execution: each function executes its piece (Merch recall/return…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Coordinate execution: each function executes its piece (Merch recall/return VS-89, IT fix VS-27, HR staffing VS-103, Facilities repair VS-138, LP investigation VS-23), with the coordinator tracking the integrated resolution
Responsible (R): Functional Leads / Coordinator
Accountable (A): Support Center Lead
Duration: Per case</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5125_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5125_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5125_Task8" name="Close, debrief &amp; systemize: confirm integrated resolution to the store, debrief…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Close, debrief &amp; systemize: confirm integrated resolution to the store, debrief the cross-functional case for systemic-fix (VS-133), and feed the coordination-effectiveness analytics (W5127)
Responsible (R): Coordinator / Analytics
Accountable (A): Director Field Retail Operations
Duration: Per case</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5125_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5125_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W5125_End9" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W5125_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
