        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-763 (ensure controlled execution — Store Support Center, Escalation &amp; Field Operations Analytics (PA-177.3).) | - CTL-763: single accountable coordinator; linked sub-tasks per function; integrated-resolution confirmation
Owner: Store Support Center Lead / Director Field Retail Operations</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
