    <bpmn:process id="W_W5126" name="W5126. Store Knowledge Base, SOP Support &amp; Field Self-Service Enablement" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Support-center setup (W5121); recurring issues; new program/policy
Frequency: Continuous build + refresh
Volume: ~1 knowledge base serving 200 stores + field
Owner: Director Field Retail Operations / Knowledge Mgmt (VS-30.3)
Participants: Store Ops (VS-07), functional SMEs, Knowledge Mgmt (VS-30.3), L&amp;D (VS-19.4), IT (VS-27)
Source: workflow W5126 — Store Knowledge Base, SOP Support &amp; Field Self-Service Enablement</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W5126_LaneSet4">
