        <bpmn:outgoing>W5126_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5126_Task6" name="Build &amp; maintain the knowledge base: SOPs, policy clarifications, FAQ…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Build &amp; maintain the knowledge base: SOPs, policy clarifications, FAQ, how-to/job-aids for recurring store issues, and the source-of-truth governance (links VS-88 records / VS-30.3 knowledge)
Responsible (R): SMEs / Knowledge Mgmt / Director Field Retail Operations
Accountable (A): Director Field Retail Operations
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5126_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5126_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5126_Task7" name="Enable field self-service: searchable knowledge base at the store/field, the…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Enable field self-service: searchable knowledge base at the store/field, the deflection target (issues resolved without a ticket), and integration with the support-center tool (W5121) &amp; L&amp;D (VS-19.4)
Responsible (R): IT / Knowledge Mgmt / Director Field Retail Operations
Accountable (A): Director Field Retail Operations
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5126_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5126_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5126_Task8" name="Measure &amp; improve: deflection rate, KB-article usefulness, gap-detection…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Measure &amp; improve: deflection rate, KB-article usefulness, gap-detection (issues with no article), and the refresh cycle (VS-133)
Responsible (R): Analytics / Knowledge Mgmt
Accountable (A): Director Field Retail Operations
Duration: Monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5126_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5126_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W5126_End9" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W5126_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
