    <bpmn:process id="W_W5127" name="W5127. Field &amp; Store Operations Performance Dashboard &amp; Comp-Store Analytics" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Continuous; monthly/quarterly review
Frequency: Real-time + monthly/quarterly
Volume: 200 stores + ~14–16 field managers + regions/districts
Owner: Director Field Retail Operations / Analytics (VS-28)
Participants: Analytics (VS-28), Store Ops (VS-07), Strategy (VS-33), Finance FP&amp;A (VS-17.4), CX (VS-13), LP (VS-23)
Source: workflow W5127 — Field &amp; Store Operations Performance Dashboard &amp; Comp-Store Analytics</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W5127_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W5127_Lane1" name="Analytics">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5127_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5127_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5127_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5127_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5127_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W5127_Start3" name="Continuous; monthly/quarterly review">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5127_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5127_Task4" name="Build &amp; maintain the field dashboard: per-store, per-manager…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Build &amp; maintain the field dashboard: per-store, per-manager, per-region/district roll-up of sales, comp-sales, margin, shrink (VS-23), CX (VS-13), standards-compliance (W5114), inventory turn, visit-cadence adherence, action-item closure, and support-center SLA
Responsible (R): Analytics / Director Field Retail Operations
Accountable (A): Director Field Retail Operations
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5127_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5127_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5127_Task5" name="Run comp-store &amp; benchmark analytics: comparable-store sales (new/excluded…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Run comp-store &amp; benchmark analytics: comparable-store sales (new/excluded stores), peer/region benchmark ranking (W5109), the cohort/maturity view, and the outlier/detection signals
Responsible (R): Analytics / Strategy / Director Field Retail Operations
Accountable (A): Director Field Retail Operations
Duration: Monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5127_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5127_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5127_Task6" name="Distribute &amp; drive action: leadership/field distribution, drill-down…">
