Responsible (R): Director Field Retail Operations / OpEx / OCM
Accountable (A): VP Store Operations
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5128_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5128_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
